{"version":1,"content":"<p>視后江美儀近日接受陳敏之主持的網上節目訪問，暢談入行以來的經歷。</p><p>她重提當年拍攝無綫劇《名媛望族》及《衝上雲霄II》時所承受的壓力及低潮，尤其《衝》劇內她與馬國明上演的情慾戲慘遭網民狠批，被狂罵「重口味」及「老牛吃嫩草」。</p><p>排山倒海的惡評令她一</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.287763+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:12:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T18:47:33.365930+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_hash":"27643140d89c41e33108daabcb8d4de503ef84f8d843da93127053034dd42c6b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}